7090
03:00:27,680 --> 03:00:28,680
co bylo v našich silách,

7091
03:00:28,740 --> 03:00:29,460
co jsme mohli.

7092
03:00:30,900 --> 03:00:32,380
Víte, že jsme adresovali

7093
03:00:32,380 --> 03:00:34,420
